          "Factor out the constant $2$: $2\\int \\frac{1}{5x-1}\\,dx$.",
          "Apply the formula with $a = 5$: $\\frac{1}{5}\\ln|5x-1|$.",
          "Multiply by $2$ to get $\\frac{2}{5}\\ln|5x-1| + c$."
